column3:
{0}
Auto-targeting radius is biased toward your aim direction.

{1}
Auto-targeting radius is equal in all directions.

{0}
Decreased Auto-target bias for nearby enemies.

{1}
Increased Auto-target bias for nearby enemies.

{0}
Target Softlock is disabled. Use {2} to aim manually on targets.

{1}
Target Softlock is enabled. Use {2} to target lock an enemy for a short duration.

{0}
Auto-targeting priortises your {2} move direction.

{1}
Auto-targeting priotises targets in the direction your character is facing.
